title: "A Simplified Data Analysis Using an AI Teammate Exploration Cookbook"
abstract: "A Project Pythia cookbook that uses an AI teammate to make data science more approachable for beginners. Working from a dataset of penguin species, it builds core skills through short lessons with an AI assistant, covering data cleaning and visualization, prediction and machine learning, and data interpretation and communication. The focus throughout is on reproducible, open, and equitable learning."
